{"turn_index": 9, "category": "chat", "user_input": "为什么工具执行结果需要回填给模型？", "tools_called": [], "answer": "为了让模型基于最新事实进行下一步决策。\n\n工具执行结果代表了外部世界的真实状态或操作反馈，只有将其回填到上下文（Context）中，模型才能“看到”刚才发生了什么，从而判断任务是否完成、是否需要修正策略或调用下一个工具，确保 Agent Loop 能够持续、正确地推进。", "steps_used": 1, "success": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1906.0, "message_count_before_run": 18, "estimated_tokens_at_run_start": 285, "prepare_session_triggered": true, "compressed_message_count": 0, "estimated_tokens_after_prepare": 341, "message_count_after_run": 20, "estimated_tokens_after_run": 341, "summary_chars_before": 0, "summary_chars_after": 0, "orphan_tool_results": [], "missing_tool_results": []}
{"turn_index": 10, "category": "chat", "user_input": "纯对话追问和带工具追问有什么区别？", "tools_called": [], "answer": "区别在于是否触发外部能力调用及上下文更新方式。\n\n纯对话追问仅依赖模型内部知识和历史对话记录进行推理，不改变外部环境；带工具追问则会触发 Agent 调用外部工具（如搜索、计算、API），并将工具的执行结果回填到上下文中，使模型能基于最新的、真实的外部信息进行后续决策。", "steps_used": 1, "success": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 4844.0, "message_count_before_run": 20, "estimated_tokens_at_run_start": 341, "prepare_session_triggered": true, "compressed_message_count": 0, "estimated_tokens_after_prepare": 398, "message_count_after_run": 22, "estimated_tokens_after_run": 398, "summary_chars_before": 0, "summary_chars_after": 0, "orphan_tool_results": [], "missing_tool_results": []}
{"turn_index": 11, "category": "chat", "user_input": "为什么不能把全部 Trace 都塞进模型 Context？", "tools_called": [], "answer": "因为会导致上下文窗口溢出、推理成本激增以及注意力分散。\n\n模型对输入长度有硬性限制（Context Window），全量 Trace 极易超限；同时，过多的无关细节会增加 Token 消耗和延迟，并引入“噪声”，干扰模型对关键信息的关注，从而降低决策质量。因此通常需要对 Context 进行压缩、摘要或选择性保留。", "steps_used": 1, "success": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 2375.0, "message_count_before_run": 22, "estimated_tokens_at_run_start": 398, "prepare_session_triggered": true, "compressed_message_count": 0, "estimated_tokens_after_prepare": 463, "message_count_after_run": 24, "estimated_tokens_after_run": 463, "summary_chars_before": 0, "summary_chars_after": 0, "orphan_tool_results": [], "missing_tool_results": []}
{"turn_index": 12, "category": "chat", "user_input": "为什么不应该保存完整隐藏思维链？", "tools_called": [], "answer": "因为存在安全风险、隐私泄露隐患以及存储效率低下的问题。\n\n完整隐藏思维链可能包含敏感数据、内部逻辑漏洞或未过滤的中间状态，直接保存易被恶意利用或泄露；此外，其体积庞大且冗余度高，长期存储成本高昂，通常只需保留关键决策点或摘要即可满足调试与审计需求。", "steps_used": 1, "success": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 2234.0, "message_count_before_run": 24, "estimated_tokens_at_run_start": 463, "prepare_session_triggered": true, "compressed_message_count": 0, "estimated_tokens_after_prepare": 516, "message_count_after_run": 26, "estimated_tokens_after_run": 516, "summary_chars_before": 0, "summary_chars_after": 0, "orphan_tool_results": [], "missing_tool_results": []}
{"turn_index": 13, "category": "chat", "user_input": "Session Summary 应该放在主 System Prompt 之前还是之后？", "tools_called": [], "answer": "应该放在主 System Prompt 之后，但在用户最新输入之前。\n\n因为 System Prompt 定义了角色的核心行为准则和基础指令，具有最高优先级；而 Session Summary 是对历史对话的动态压缩，属于上下文信息。将其置于 System Prompt 之后，可以确保模型在遵循核心规则的前提下，利用摘要信息理解当前语境，避免摘要内容干扰或覆盖基础指令。", "steps_used": 1, "success": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 2516.0, "message_count_before_run": 26, "estimated_tokens_at_run_start": 516, "prepare_session_triggered": true, "compressed_message_count": 0, "estimated_tokens_after_prepare": 591, "message_count_after_run": 28, "estimated_tokens_after_run": 591, "summary_chars_before": 0, "summary_chars_after": 0, "orphan_tool_results": [], "missing_tool_results": []}
{"turn_index": 14, "category": "chat", "user_input": "为什么最近几轮原始消息不应该立即被摘要？", "tools_called": [], "answer": "因为近期对话包含最高优先级的即时语境和细节，立即摘要会导致关键信息丢失或失真。\n\n模型对最近的信息关注度最高，原始消息能提供最准确的指令、约束和上下文状态；而摘要本质上是有损压缩，过早替换会削弱模型对当前任务细微差别的理解能力，通常应保留最近几轮原文，仅对更早期的历史进行摘要。", "steps_used": 1, "success": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 2390.0, "message_count_before_run": 28, "estimated_tokens_at_run_start": 591, "prepare_session_triggered": true, "compressed_message_count": 0, "estimated_tokens_after_prepare": 649, "message_count_after_run": 30, "estimated_tokens_after_run": 649, "summary_chars_before": 0, "summary_chars_after": 0, "orphan_tool_results": [], "missing_tool_results": []}
